    "quote": "Manufacturers shall report every thermal incident involving overheating, smoke, fire, or thermal runaway to the relevant regulator within 24 hours of learning of it, including incidents not resulting in injury or property damage. Within 72 hours, the manufacturer shall notify the affected unit's owner of known hazards and interim precautions."
   },
