    "quote": "New units manufactured 24 months after this standard takes effect shall support remote emergency shut-off, with safeguards against unauthorized activation and clear customer instructions. Manufacturers shall retrofit already-installed units to support remote emergency shut-off within six years after the standard takes effect, where technically feasible, and shall notify owners of any units that cannot be retrofitted and provide safe-use guidance."
   },
